'''Latte''' is a [[Legendary Weapons|legendary]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing it from the Latte Pack for 399 Robux during the [[Thanksgiving Event 2023|2023 Thanksgiving Event.]] It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
This knife uses the default knife mesh. Its blade is brown with a cream gradient at the top of it, resembling frothy cream of a latte. The guard is brown and the handle is a very dark brown. 

== Trivia ==
* It has a [[Latte (Gun)|partner gun]] under the same name, making the [https://murder-mystery-2.fandom.com/wiki/Murder_Mystery_2_Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Latte_Set Latte Set].

